<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγ-ωγός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing up, eliciting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτυάλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>raising</i> or <i>conveying up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ διὰ τοῦ πυρὸς προσαγωγὴ τῶν θυσιῶν
					ἀ. ἐπὶ τὸ οὐράνιον πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					5.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>uplifting the soul, elevating,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					5.173c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				14.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				158
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωτηρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Isid.</u>
					232
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ τρίτου εἰς τὸ πρῶτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
